{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/f9bb44c5a4d4a88dd06dd4d48ac87acf.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can sail a ship with your friends toward distant horizons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore faraway islands, hunt for treasures, and discover the perfect fishing spots!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5f03129e91b934188a3fddda5753c9a3.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/f6bbd6ead1a5f3c4b55ac916ab449e00.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip out your fishing rod anytime, anywhere\u2014cast your bait into the water and start fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish of all sizes, rare species, and even bizarre mutated fish tainted by pollution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1d99765d6b7251749327a4cb6e874e59.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4765301214a572eb3d0aada4a843d3e5.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farmland\u2014it will be your vital source of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate crops you\u2019ve discovered from exploring other islands in your fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/29ec5c702e18c18062865cb5cd7edd06.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ec0915dee53eea898598d14e0152b03e.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets are your best companions, ready to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let them roam freely around your homestead, or pick one to adventure by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth and find pets across different islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ae6d96b4dadb378c23d851b9f46ce9b4.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5315d7ede736df191d90be19d502e161.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the ingredients you\u2019ve farmed or scavenged into the cooking pot\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait\u2026 wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a delicious feast will be ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655990?t=1757932374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/b17a515f670f409afe0549c9138c7981e6090311/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757932374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/24026bb30aed0a645ebc7e66df08c7e3e391869f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757932374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/24026bb30aed0a645ebc7e66df08c7e3e391869f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757932374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/f9bb44c5a4d4a88dd06dd4d48ac87acf.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can sail a ship with your friends toward distant horizons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore faraway islands, hunt for treasures, and discover the perfect fishing spots!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5f03129e91b934188a3fddda5753c9a3.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/f6bbd6ead1a5f3c4b55ac916ab449e00.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip out your fishing rod anytime, anywhere\u2014cast your bait into the water and start fishing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish of all sizes, rare species, and even bizarre mutated fish tainted by pollution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/1d99765d6b7251749327a4cb6e874e59.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/4765301214a572eb3d0aada4a843d3e5.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your farmland\u2014it will be your vital source of food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate crops you\u2019ve discovered from exploring other islands in your fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/29ec5c702e18c18062865cb5cd7edd06.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ec0915dee53eea898598d14e0152b03e.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets are your best companions, ready to lend a hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let them roam freely around your homestead, or pick one to adventure by your side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth and find pets across different islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/ae6d96b4dadb378c23d851b9f46ce9b4.avif?t=1757932374\" width=614 height=310 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655990/extras/5315d7ede736df191d90be19d502e161.avif?t=1757932374\" width=620 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the ingredients you\u2019ve farmed or scavenged into the cooking pot\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait\u2026 wait\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And a delicious feast will be ready!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u70df\u718f\u6e14"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id"